{"data": {"acceptance": ["Whitespace-only edits whose source units cannot be realigned emit a component warning and persist user_whitespace_realign_incomplete once in cleanup.json warnings.", "All three chapter detectors accept valid uppercase bare Roman numerals and reject lowercase or invalid Roman-only words including I, did, mix, and civil as specified by case and grammar.", "A matching completed Cleanup checkpoint whose clean_text.txt is missing or hash-invalid is rerendered deterministically without an LLM request and returns completed output.", "create_project raises a friendly FileExistsError when the target path is an existing file and leaves it unchanged.", "Paragraph reason_codes remain available as provenance, while warning_flags and downstream cleanup_warning_flags contain only the explicit real warning-code set; the strict chunk field set does not change.", "The translation reset comment, validate_project_name @version indentation, and missing module-level blank lines are corrected.", "test_logging_service.py no longer begins with a UTF-8 BOM and its content otherwise remains unchanged.", "Focused tests for behavior items 1-5, Ruff, compilation, traceability, coverage, documentation review, and impact pass without running the full pytest suite."], "assumptions": ["Bare Roman numerals are recognized only when uppercase and valid under the non-empty standard Roman grammar; prefixed Chapter/Scene labels retain case-insensitive behavior.", "A failed whitespace realignment appends the stable Cleanup warning token user_whitespace_realign_incomplete and logs a component warning, while the operator edit remains persisted as required by the ticket.", "Real Cleanup paragraph warning flags are the explicit tokens deterministic_fallback, unknown_line_boundary, and page_transition_repaired; all other reason_codes remain provenance only.", "A completed Cleanup checkpoint with a missing or hash-invalid clean_text.txt is deterministically rerendered without an LLM call.", "The owner-deferred full pytest gate is replaced by focused tests for items 1-5, full Ruff, compilation, audits, and later manual app verification."], "created_at": "2026-07-30T17:34:02+00:00", "decision": "proceed", "open_questions": [], "planned_paths": ["04_Software/AudioMancer/src/audiomancer/services/text_cleanup_service.py", "04_Software/AudioMancer/src/audiomancer/services/chunking_document_service.py", "04_Software/AudioMancer/src/audiomancer/services/deterministic_chunking_service.py", "04_Software/AudioMancer/src/audiomancer/services/cleanup_text_analysis_service.py", "04_Software/AudioMancer/src/audiomancer/services/project_workspace_service.py", "04_Software/AudioMancer/src/audiomancer/services/cleanup_metadata_service.py", "04_Software/AudioMancer/src/audiomancer/services/operation_runtime_service.py", "04_Software/AudioMancer/tests/test_cleanup_service.py", "04_Software/AudioMancer/tests/test_cleanup_quality_contract.py", "04_Software/AudioMancer/tests/test_deterministic_chunking_service.py", "04_Software/AudioMancer/tests/test_project_workspace_service.py", "04_Software/AudioMancer/tests/test_cleanup_metadata_service.py", "04_Software/AudioMancer/tests/test_logging_service.py", ".agentic/specs/cleanup_chunking.spec.md", ".agentic/requirements", ".agentic/knowledge/components/Text_Cleanup.md", ".agentic/knowledge/components/Text_Chunking.md", ".agentic/knowledge/components/Project_Lifecycle.md"], "reason": "Each fix is local, existing component baselines and tests are strong, no persisted field set changes, and the assumptions make the two discretionary ticket choices explicit and testable.", "recommended_responses": [], "risk": "low", "scope": ["In scope: the seven ticket items, focused regression checks, minimal existing requirement/spec/component-document updates, and no change to the strict chunks_text.json field set. Out of scope: compatibility shims, schema migrations, broad refactors, ticket #40, changing starts_after_scene_separator, commits, pushes, PRs, Gitea mutations, or the full pytest suite."], "source": "Gitea issue #38 read through authenticated tea CLI plus owner instruction on 2026-07-30", "understanding": "Implement the seven independent robustness and consistency items as one bounded change: diagnose whitespace realignment failure both in the component log and Cleanup document; make bare Roman-numeral headings strict and uppercase-only in all three detectors; rerender a matching completed Cleanup checkpoint when clean_text.txt is missing or hash-invalid; reject a project target that is an existing file with a friendly FileExistsError; separate paragraph provenance reason_codes from a small explicit warning-code set before downstream chunk and Speech Blocks projection; correct three comments/docstrings/spacing defects; and remove the sole UTF-8 BOM."}, "event": "alignment.recorded", "time": "2026-07-30T17:34:02+00:00"}
